{"availability":"available","full":"ESA-PhiLab/PyRawS","name":"PyRawS","description":"Python for Raw Sentinel-2 data (PyRawS) is an open-source software providing utilities to open and process Sentinel 2 RAW data, which corresponds to a decompressed version of Level-0 data with additional metadata. The software is demonstrated on the first Sentinel-2 dataset containing raw data for warm temperature hotspots detection/classification.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":93,"forks":10,"created":"2023-04-11T23:59:19Z","updated":"2026-02-09T09:20:03Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://esa-philab.github.io/PyRawS/","topics":["detection","onboard-computer","sentinel","wildfires"],"demo":"https://esa-philab.github.io/PyRawS/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:25.998Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:25.998Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:25.998Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T00:30:25.998Z","stars":93,"forks":10}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["(Disclaimer: This project is currently under development.)","Python for RAW Sentinel-2 data (PyRawS) is a powerful open-source Python package that provides a comprehensive set of tools for working with Sentinel-2 Raw data🔬. 1 It provides utilities for coarse spatial bands coregistration, geo-referencing, data visualization📊, and image processing🖼️. The software is demonstrated on the first Sentinel-2 🛰️ Raw database for warm temperature hotspots 🔥 detection/classification, making it an ideal tool for a wide range of applications in remote sensing and earth observation🌍. The package is written in Python and is open source💻, making it easy to use…","NB: What we call raw data in this project are Sentinel-2 data generated by the decompression and metadata addition of Sentinel-2 L0 data. Because of that, with the exception of the effects due to onboard equalization and lossy compression, they are the most similar version of the rawest form of data acquired by the satellite's sensors. Both the compression and equalization are applied onboard the satellite to reduce the amount of data transmitted to the ground station. For easy naming convention, this repo refer to the term \"Raw\" as the products decompressed with ancillary information…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ESA-PhiLab/PyRawS/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"88d42dff5d19621dc1cdd6af73b65e4e58db0d28a69c283600b76b055692f885","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:26.101Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:26.101Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"(Disclaimer: This project is currently under development.)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ESA-PhiLab/PyRawS/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"88d42dff5d19621dc1cdd6af73b65e4e58db0d28a69c283600b76b055692f885","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ESA-PhiLab/PyRawS/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:26.101Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-02-09T09:20:03Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ESA-PhiLab/PyRawS/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T00:30:26.102Z","hash":"88d42dff5d19621dc1cdd6af73b65e4e58db0d28a69c283600b76b055692f885","originalBytes":17279,"storedBytes":17279,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["raw","sentinel-2","data","granules","bands","event","pyraws","l1c","sentinel-2-raw-granule","sentinel-2-raw-data","coregistration","events","area","band","granule","one","useful","image","please","project","information","interest","python","raw-useful-granule","refer","sentinel-2-raw-event","thraws","collection","contains","database","dataset","download","each","processing","products","resources","set","those","above","applied","b8a","complementary","document","feature","github","given","ground","images","intersects","new","onboard","only","open","rectangular","scripts","specification","various","volcanic","whose","addition","certai